---
const VIDEOJS_URL = 'https://videojs.org/?utm_source=media-chrome&utm_medium=docs-banner';
---

<aside class="videojs-banner" aria-label="Video.js">
  <p>
    <strong>Media Chrome, meet Video.js 👋</strong>
    The team behind Media Chrome now builds Video.js, an HTML-first player with the best of Media Chrome, Plyr and
    Vidstack. Starting something new? <a href={VIDEOJS_URL}>Try Video.js&nbsp;→</a>
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .videojs-banner {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--theme-divider);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--theme-accent);
    background-color: var(--theme-bg-offset);
    font-size: 0.95em;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .videojs-banner p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .videojs-banner strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .videojs-banner a {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
